 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-ROWS.
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P head root 0 1 0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C head 0 0 -4 -8 -4 8 8 8 g 0".
